flowchart LR
  AL[Alert] --> VAL{Valid against current state?}
  VAL -->|no| STALE[STALE - discarded]
  VAL -->|yes| COR{Related open incident?}
  COR -->|graph-connected| ATT[Attach as symptom]
  COR -->|no| NEW[New incident + impact + triage P1-P4]
  ATT --> RCA[Deterministic root cause]
  NEW --> RCA
  RCA --> PLAN[Plan for root cause] --> DEC[Decision]
  DEC --> TX[Transaction] --> RES{Symptoms cleared?}
  RES -->|yes| R[RESOLVED]
  RES -->|no| MIT[MITIGATED]
